  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡¿Cuántas veces te lo tengo que repetir?!\n¡Mi Arbok es el más fuerte!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100BF0043007500E1006E0074006100730020007600650063006500730020007400650020006C006F002000740065006E0067006F002000710075006500200072006500700065007400690072003F0021000A00A1004D00690020004100720062006F006B00200065007300200065006C0020006D00E1007300200066007500650072007400650021001000020114001B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Uy, ¡qué mieeedo! ¿Qué va a hacer, restregarme\nlos dibujitos de su vientre por la cara?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¡Por favor! Nadie se compara con Glalie.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 136
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Eh! ¿Y tú qué miras?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004500680021002000BF00590020007400FA00200071007500E90020006D0069007200610073003F001000020114001B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Aprovechando que estás aquí, ven y ayúdanos\na resolver esto de una vez!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Lo único que tienes que hacer es enfrentarte\na nosotros en un combate.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yo voy primero. Lucha contra mi Arbok\nen un uno contra uno.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F00200076006F00790020007000720069006D00650072006F002E0020004C007500630068006100200063006F006E0074007200610020006D00690020004100720062006F006B000A0065006E00200075006E00200075006E006F00200063006F006E00740072006100200075006E006F002E001000020114001B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y luego te enfrentas al Glalie de él,\ntambién en un uno contra uno.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00590020006C007500650067006F00200074006500200065006E006600720065006E00740061007300200061006C00200047006C0061006C00690065002000640065002000E9006C002C000A00740061006D0062006900E9006E00200065006E00200075006E00200075006E006F00200063006F006E00740072006100200075006E006F002E001000020114001B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Está decidido!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¡Lucha contra los dos, así le quedará claro que\nmi Pokémon es mil veces mejor que el suyo!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 114
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Enfréntate a mi Arbok para que se calle\neste payaso. ¡En un uno contra uno!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Te venceré",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540065002000760065006E00630065007200E90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me tengo que preparar antes",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0065002000740065006E0067006F002000710075006500200070007200650070006100720061007200200061006E0074006500730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Date prisa entonces! ¡Elige al Pokémon que más\nte guste y vamos!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004400610074006500200070007200690073006100200065006E0074006F006E0063006500730021002000A10045006C00690067006500200061006C00200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200071007500650020006D00E10073000A0074006500200067007500730074006500200079002000760061006D006F00730021001000020114001B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oye, ¡yo voy a luchar solamente con Arbok!\nNo es justo si tú llevas más de un Pokémon.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Eres muy insolente! ¡Te voy a derrotar\nen un abrir y cerrar de ojos!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100450072006500730020006D0075007900200069006E0073006F006C0065006E007400650021002000A10054006500200076006F00790020006100200064006500720072006F007400610072000A0065006E00200075006E0020006100620072006900720020007900200063006500720072006100720020006400650020006F006A006F00730021001000020114001B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dale una buena lección a este pelmazo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00440061006C006500200075006E00610020006200750065006E00610020006C006500630063006900F3006E0020006100200065007300740065002000700065006C006D0061007A006F002E001000020114001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mi Arbok... ¿perdió?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00690020004100720062006F006B002E002E002E002000BF0070006500720064006900F3003F001000020114001B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Eso te pasa por presumido! ¿Ves que tu Arbok\nes un debilucho? ¡Mi Glalie es mejor!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Ahora es nuestro turno! ¡Acabemos con esto\nrapidito y nos vamos a casa!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Te toca enfrentarte a mi Glalie en un uno contra\nuno. ¿Estás list<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A ti también te voy a vencer",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041002000740069002000740061006D0062006900E9006E00200074006500200076006F007900200061002000760065006E0063006500720000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me tengo que preparar antes",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0065002000740065006E0067006F002000710075006500200070007200650070006100720061007200200061006E0074006500730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Te dio miedito? Está claro que ningún\nPokémon le puede ganar.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF00540065002000640069006F0020006D00690065006400690074006F003F002000450073007400E100200063006C00610072006F00200071007500650020006E0069006E006700FA006E000A0050006F006B00E9006D006F006E0020006C0065002000700075006500640065002000670061006E00610072002E001000020114001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A ver, ¿qué parte de \"uno contra uno\"\nno entiendes?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410020007600650072002C002000BF0071007500E9002000700061007200740065002000640065002000220075006E006F00200063006F006E00740072006100200075006E006F0022000A006E006F00200065006E007400690065006E006400650073003F001000020114001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Te voy a derrotar!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10054006500200076006F00790020006100200064006500720072006F0074006100720021001000020114001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vaya... ¿Cómo eres tan fuerte?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006100790061002E002E002E002000BF004300F3006D006F00200065007200650073002000740061006E0020006600750065007200740065003F001000020114001B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Barrió el suelo con mi Glalie también...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 3512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042006100720072006900F300200065006C0020007300750065006C006F00200063006F006E0020006D006900200047006C0061006C00690065002000740061006D0062006900E9006E002E002E002E001000020114001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Uff, por sabelotodo! ¡Nos dio una paliza a los dos!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 3604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005500660066002C00200070006F007200200073006100620065006C006F0074006F0064006F0021002000A1004E006F0073002000640069006F00200075006E0061002000700061006C0069007A0061002000610020006C006F007300200064006F00730021001000020114001B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Lo que significa... que ni mi Arbok\nni tu Glalie son los más fuertes...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 3720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>¡Es verdad! ¡Tu <U+0010><U+0002>ā<U+0002> es el más fuerte\nde todos!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 3872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BD06000000A10045007300200076006500720064006100640021002000A1005400750020001000020101000200200065007300200065006C0020006D00E100730020006600750065007200740065000A0064006500200074006F0064006F00730021001000020114001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nos falta mucho...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nNo podríamos con <U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿЂélella ni aunque los Lechonk\nvolaran.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 3984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me abriste los ojos. Ya sé lo que quiero hacer\ncon mi vida. Lo veo claramente.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Yo también!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¡Ahora tengo clarísimo que nunca voy\na dejar que este zoquete me supere!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 4324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Qué te crees, zopenco! ¡Te vas a tener que\nenfrentar a mí para siempre!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 4512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    }
  ],
